Package: PlanteryTime
Title: Calculate Location-Based Planetary Days and Hours
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Killian",
        family = "Williams",
        email = "williamskillian@outlook.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Calculates planetary day and hour rulers from timestamps,
    geographic coordinates, and time zones. Divides daylight and nighttime
    into twelve intervals each using calculated sunrise and sunset times.
    Provides functions for generating schedules and adding planetary
    classifications to timestamped datasets.
